      "comment": "HIGH DEGREES (3) has been in the minors the last two, the latest showing strong pace early but gathered in and finished a 3.5 lengths second over 388m Gosford in 22.43. Likely to feature again. FRANKIE'S ANGEL (4) box seated before sticking on well to finish 4.5 lengths away in third (23.18) at this track in a Grade 5 over 400m. Winning chance. JILLY HILL (8) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when seventh at Gosford over 388m behind Reborn Passion (23.03) in a Grade 5. Deserves plenty of respect.",
